data: {"id": "b4cf455954b743c3-thinking-parallel_evidence-985", "run_id": "b4cf455954b743c3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**关键事实汇总：**\n1.  **状态确认**：Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 确认为 `Pending`，UID `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`，未分配到节点。\n2.  **调度原因**：`FailedScheduling` 事件明确指出：`3 Insufficient memory`。\n3.  **资源请求异常**：Pod YAML 显示 `memory` 请求量为 **1Pi** (1 Pebibyte, 2^50 bytes)。\n4.  **节点能力**：集群 3 个节点均为 `Ready` 状态，无任何 `Taint` 或 `Affinity` 配置阻挡。\n5.  **可观测性状态**：由于未启动，Metrics 显示 Waiting 原因（与 Pending 阶段一致），日志和 Tracing 为空属于预期。\n\n**证据采集结论：**\n- 支持根因的证据：\n  - **Prometheus**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 为 1 (Pending)，且 `kube_pod_con", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789112117652, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

