data: {"id": "b4cf455954b743c3-final", "run_id": "b4cf455954b743c3", "seq": 990, "ts_ms": 1789112134702, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 处于 Pending 状态，未分配到节点 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.condition | 条件 `PodScheduled` 为 `False`，原因 `Unschedulable`，消息包含 `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` | 直接描述 Pod 调度的失败机制与系统判定状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | event.message | `FailedScheduling` 事件，明确提示 `3 Insufficient memory` 且 `No preemption victims found for incoming pod` | 记录调度器拒绝 Pod 的具体事件反馈 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | container.resource_request.memory | 容器 `app` 的资源请求内存为 `1Pi` | 揭示导致调度失败的根源配置参数 |\n| 4 | K8s State | pod.status / phase | 状态为 `Pending`，Phase 为 `Pending` | 证实 Pod 因调度失败而停滞在初始阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | kube_pod_status_phase | 容器 `kube-state-metrics` 的 `Pending` 状态值为 1，`Running` 状态值为 0 (样本数各 1) | 提供 Pod 生命周期状态的量化佐证，排除已运行可能性 |\n\n**证据链说明**\n1. 证据 3 中的 `1Pi` 内存请求量在常规集群环境中极为异常，直接导致节点无法满足调度要求。\n2. 证据 1、2 分别从 Pod 条件和事件层面一致确认了 `Insufficient memory` 是阻塞调度的唯一原因。\n3. 证据 4、5 进一步从不同维度（状态字段与指标监控）交叉印证了 Pod 长期处于 Pending 状态，未启动容器，因此缺失 Logging 和 Tracing 数据属正常物理现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 配置了 1Pi 的内存请求 (fact 3) → 集群可用节点内存不足 1Pi，无法满足资源请求 (fact 1, 2) → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling 且无节点可抢占 (fact 2) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态 (fact 4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为**Pod 资源配置错误**。`workload` 中的 `app` 容器将内存请求（`resource_request.memory`）配置为 `1Pi`（事实 #3），该数值远超 3 个集群节点的物理内存总和。这直接触发了 `default-scheduler` 的 `FailedScheduling` 事件（事实 #2），判定所有节点均 `Insufficient memory`，进而导致 Pod 状态被阻塞为 `Pending`（事实 #1, #4）。现有 Kubernetes 事件与资源配置事实已充分闭合该逻辑链条。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 35.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 30.4s (Evidence 22.5s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 75.281, "metrics": {"run_id": "b4cf455954b743c3", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 75.28740668296814, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 75287.40668296814, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 71248.06666374207, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 9625.614643096924, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3683.0291748046875}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 35751.80149078369, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "d